0.2.0
- Added the first keyboard and mouse planner window with fixed equipment slots.
- Added build and setup selectors, naming actions, deletion confirmation, and undo.
- Added set-name autocomplete from Item Set Collections and previously entered sets.
- Added contextual armor, weapon, trait, quality, level, enchantment, and note fields.
- Added a main-menu entry when LibMainMenu-2.0 is available, /buildplanner and
  /gbp commands, and a configurable keybinding.

0.1.0
- Added the initial account-wide build and setup data model.
- Added canonical armor, jewelry, and weapon slots with two-handed weapon handling.
- Added create, copy, reorder, delete, and undo operations for builds and setups.
- Added English, French, and Spanish foundation strings.
